title Business Model Canvas: tender-to-PO SaaS for Saudi mid-size companies
* Tender-to-PO SaaS\nsealed, branded, audit-ready
** 1. Customer Segments <<seg>>
*** Payer: Saudi private firms, 100 to 1,000 staff
*** Beachhead: construction and manufacturing
*** First: firms under audit pressure (pre-IPO, internal audit, government contractors)
*** Free side: their vendors (117,000 registered contractors)
** 2. Value Propositions <<val>>
*** Prove the tender was fair
*** Prices sealed until technical scores are locked; no change after the deadline
*** One audit bundle for the board and the auditor
*** Live in a day, monthly price, data in Saudi Arabia
** 3. Channels <<chan>>
*** Founder-led Arabic demos
*** Vendor loop: each tender brings 5 to 8 vendors
*** Odoo and SAP B1 partners, audit firms, Monshaat
** 4. Customer Relationships <<rel>>
*** Free first tender, done with you
*** Arabic WhatsApp support
*** Lock-in: audit archive, vendor book, templates
** 5. Revenue Streams <<rev>>
*** SAR 1,500 / 3,500 / 7,500 a month per tenant
*** About SAR 30,000 per tenant a year; vendors free
*** Add-ons: CR check, PO e-signature, AI pack
left side
** 8. Key Partners <<part>>
*** Saudi-region cloud
*** Wathq, e-signature, SMS providers
*** ERP partners, audit firms, Monshaat
** 7. Key Activities <<act>>
*** Build and run the platform
*** Sell, and onboard vendors per tender
*** PDPL compliance
** 6. Key Resources <<res>>
*** Sealed-envelope engine and audit log
*** White-label, Arabic-first UI
*** Vendor network, one Saudi hire
** 9. Cost Structure <<cost>>
*** Salaries, under Saudization rules
*** Hosting, AI, SMS: about SAR 220 per tenant a month
*** Lean fixed cost with 2 hires: SAR 450k to 650k a year
@endmindmap
